{"name": "Whatever It Takes", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Whatever It Takes</strong> is a hardcore first-person Action RPG set within the Omnisphere: a colossal graveyard of titans and a prison for those too great to perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once, you were the light of humanity\u2014their guiding force and celestial sovereign. But betrayal came from those who once knelt before you. Now, you are <strong>Illazar</strong>, an exiled god stripped of name and power. Journey through the ruins of divine sanctums, absorb the essence of forgotten beings, and reclaim your throne. <strong>Whatever it takes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras_big/ba2e763ebe3e5bf79f64f2d68d5f3a72.webp?t=1785764258\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/ba2e763ebe3e5bf79f64f2d68d5f3a72.avif?t=1785764258\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget chaotic button-mashing. Here, every movement of your mouse dictates the direction of your strike or parry. In <i>Whatever It Takes</i>, combat is not a choice\u2014it is the law of survival. Precision, rhythm, and focus are your only allies. One wrong move, and the enemy is already celebrating your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/59239f42eed7c66230b208f8cd1cf6e5.poster.avif?t=1785764258\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/59239f42eed7c66230b208f8cd1cf6e5.webm?t=1785764258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/59239f42eed7c66230b208f8cd1cf6e5.mp4?t=1785764258\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras_big/36fe9c5c709da135409ae2895bea1c0f.webp?t=1785764258\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/36fe9c5c709da135409ae2895bea1c0f.avif?t=1785764258\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An enemy is not just a health bar; they are a living organism with reinforced defenses and hidden vulnerabilities. Your steel will not pierce heavy plate\u2014you must strip enemies of their armor, break their fastenings, and strike precisely at their exposed wounds. Blind aggression leads to death; calculated brutality leads to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/6569aa7d8ef43184855121d683a0f806.poster.avif?t=1785764258\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/6569aa7d8ef43184855121d683a0f806.webm?t=1785764258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/6569aa7d8ef43184855121d683a0f806.mp4?t=1785764258\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras_big/5e3da9da600f8bcae8512b4b767a81e7.webp?t=1785764258\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/5e3da9da600f8bcae8512b4b767a81e7.avif?t=1785764258\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Omnisphere is a vertical labyrinth, and your harpoon is the ultimate tool for mastery. Soar to unreachable heights, lure enemies into deadly traps, or yank them out of formation. Weaponize the environment itself: turn height, gravity, and ruins into your most lethal assets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/491ef965944d2732ea8e6d7698b9938f.poster.avif?t=1785764258\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/491ef965944d2732ea8e6d7698b9938f.webm?t=1785764258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/491ef965944d2732ea8e6d7698b9938f.mp4?t=1785764258\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras_big/7444049fe4bae816442c12bacb1aa4b7.webp?t=1785764258\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/7444049fe4bae816442c12bacb1aa4b7.avif?t=1785764258\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Absorb the essences of fallen gods to reclaim your lost majesty. Bend time to your will, summon nightmares from the Abyss, or become an elusive wraith, passing through stone and steel alike. Every spark of stolen power brings you closer to triumph. Your abilities are not mere magic\u2014they are your right to vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/3e043a9bfa9b15323c29e6a0bb739a8c.poster.avif?t=1785764258\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/3e043a9bfa9b15323c29e6a0bb739a8c.webm?t=1785764258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/3e043a9bfa9b15323c29e6a0bb739a8c.mp4?t=1785764258\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras_big/4c6533c64ec7c0302598ccb901233e8d.webp?t=1785764258\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/4c6533c64ec7c0302598ccb901233e8d.avif?t=1785764258\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every scrap found within the ruins can serve as the foundation for a potent elixir. Experiment with ingredients and rediscover forbidden formulas that can overturn the tide of any duel. Health potions are just the beginning; secret alchemical compositions capable of granting true divine supremacy still await their discoverer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/5315aa7155977d4843d174dbb2326538.poster.avif?t=1785764258\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/5315aa7155977d4843d174dbb2326538.webm?t=1785764258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/extras/5315aa7155977d4843d174dbb2326538.mp4?t=1785764258\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Whatever It Takes is a hardcore first-person Action RPG in a dark fantasy setting. As a fallen god, master elemental magic, absorb enemy powers, and engage in tactical duels. Use a harpoon for traversal and shape the Omnisphere\u2019s fate through your choices. Reclaim your throne. Whatever it takes.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485200/3f4814dba0d96293c29dcb359dd50f32fbeffe73/header.jpg?t=1785764258", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["RPG", "Adventure", "First-Person", "Open World", "Medieval", "Realistic"], "developers": "Next Genium", "publishers": "Next Genium", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3485200", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "28 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/PcLOZEVfrh0", "first_seen": 1777327200.0, "review_rank": 762}